            R("In LIVE Studio: Add source > Link > paste (Ctrl+V).", "En LIVE Studio: Añadir fuente > Enlace > pegar (Ctrl+V).", "No LIVE Studio: Adicionar fonte > Link > colar (Ctrl+V).", "Di LIVE Studio: Tambah sumber > Tautan > tempel (Ctrl+V).", "LIVE Studio'da: Kaynak ekle > Bağlantı > yapıştır (Ctrl+V).", "In LIVE Studio: Quelle hinzufügen > Link > einfügen (Strg+V).", "Dans LIVE Studio : Ajouter une source > Lien > coller (Ctrl+V).", "Trong LIVE Studio: Thêm nguồn > Liên kết > dán (Ctrl+V)."),
            R("Show capture window", "Mostrar ventana de captura", "Mostrar janela de captura", "Tampilkan jendela tangkap", "Yakalama penceresini göster", "Aufnahmefenster zeigen", "Afficher la fenêtre de capture", "Hiện cửa sổ quay"),
